WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.062
Section 5.

00:00:02.012 --> 00:00:05.625
Other notable cases — the parade of destruction.

00:00:05.625 --> 00:00:10.175
Sylvie Therrien exposed fraud in EI processing and was fired.

00:00:10.175 --> 00:00:16.125
Sean Bruyea's medical records were shared across 100 bureaucrats in retaliation.

00:00:16.125 --> 00:00:21.337
Edgar Schmidt challenged the government's legal opinion process and was suspended.

00:00:21.337 --> 00:00:26.025
The pattern is always the same: speak the truth, lose your career.
